 ■ waiting                                                                                                           ⏸ ┃
 ■ idle                                                                                                              ○ ┃
 ■ runner                                                                                                              ┃
 ■ running                                                                                                           ▶ ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                      sort [C-g] cancel┃
```

Cancel the editor, then shrink the terminal again. The compact header restores
summary-first priority, keeping every agent-state glyph visible on the right.

    :k C-g
    :t resize-window -t runner:0 -x 56 -y 14 (success)
    :snap

